Task: Litter's kerbside draw yields to the cars (FR8) — Phase 3, task 2

Summary of changes:
- spawnParkLitter now draws from `kerbsideLotCandidates(grid)`: ring-road lots
  whose kerb (the one the piece would actually stand on, from the same
  arithmetic the placer runs) is not in takenKerbKeys().
- `kerbPiecePosition` is exported so a test can ask which kerb a lot's piece
  uses without re-implementing the offset maths.
- The park's five fixed pieces are now built from `fixedParkItems`, so the
  declaration cannot drift from where the litter goes. Same ids, same order,
  same positions as before.

