Why:
The counts are the whole story here, and they were measured rather than assumed.
Eight lots touch the ring road. Three of them lose their kerb to a parked car
((1,2), (1,3) and (4,1)) and a fourth to the puppy's spot-verge, leaving four
lots for three pieces — four distinct rounds, so the seed still means something.
A fifth exclusion anywhere would have made the draw deterministic and nothing in
the suite would have noticed, which is why the pool's size and the seed's effect
are both asserted now.

